<title>USA: Asyst names Moshier president, COO.</title>
<headline>Asyst names Moshier president, COO.</headline>
<text>
<p>FREMONT, Calif, May 20 (Reute) - Asyst Technologies Inc said Terry Moshier, Asyst's executive vice president and chief operating officer, to the new position of president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Moshier, 48, joined Asyst in July 1996 and has more than 25 years' experience in the high-tech industry.</p>
